      "worked": "Test each option, with $g$ grey socks and $10+g$ socks in total.\n$$\\begin{align*}A:\\;P(\\text{grey})&=\\frac{2}{12}=\\frac16\\\\B:\\;P(\\text{grey})&=\\frac{4}{14}=\\frac27\\\\C:\\;P(\\text{grey})&=\\frac{5}{15}=\\frac13\\\\D:\\;P(\\text{grey})&=\\frac{10}{20}=\\frac12\\end{align*}$$\nOnly option C gives $\\frac13$.",
